# =================================================================================================
# .NET build output
#
# THESE WERE TRACKED, all 1,338 of them. bin/ and obj/ carry compiled DLLs, the NuGet restore
# graph and generated AssemblyInfo files - all reproducible from source, all rewritten by every
# build. The visible cost was a `git status` permanently dirty with AssemblyInfo and .cache churn
# nobody had edited, which buries the files somebody actually changed.
#
# ANCHORED WITH ** SO THEY MATCH AT ANY DEPTH. A bare `/bin` would only match the repository root
# and would miss Services/CAM/YDots.CAM.API/obj, which is where all of it actually lives.
# =================================================================================================
**/bin/
**/obj/

# The Angular build, at any depth. `/dist` above only matches the repository root, and the UI
# builds to UI/YDots.UI/dist.
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/node_modules/

# Visual Studio / Rider local state
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
.claude/